  "description": "System-composition (.NET 5+) flavor of the CompositionExpressions typed C# DSL. Same source as arcadiog.CompositionExpressions, but the typed AST binds to the SYSTEM Windows.UI.Composition surface and takes NO dependency on the Windows App SDK / lifted Microsoft.UI.Composition. Targets net10.0-windows so it is consumable from a plain .NET 5+ project (unlike the uap10.0 asset, which trips NETSDK1149 on .NET 5+). Ships a distinct assembly name (CompositionExpressions.SystemComp) so it can coexist in one app alongside the lifted arcadiog.CompositionExpressions build. Intended for headless / system-compositor hosts (e.g. WS_EX_NOREDIRECTION_BITMAP transparent windows) that need the expression DSL without WinUI.",
